; ==========================================
; First Steps in Swahili / Kiswahili (sw)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

weka sanduku 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ongeza sanduku 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
toa sanduku 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
onyesha sanduku         ; Show the final candy count!
